poken over the telephone.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Exact statement matches the claim.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet seed.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"States the guide is not a way to process user-created sentences into a wallet seed.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"A-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets)\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly states the alternate name for user-created sentences.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"The mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text specifies a multiple of 32 bits, not 23 bits.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"With more entropy security is improved\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"but the sentence length increases\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated as part of the entropy tradeoff sentence.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"We refer to the initial entropy length as ENT.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"The allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states 128-256 bits, not 1024-2048 bytes.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-007\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA256 hash.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text specifies SHA256, not SHA652.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-008\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"This checksum is appended to the end of the initial entropy.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text says appended to the end, not the start.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-009\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text specifies groups of 11 bits, not 12 bits.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-010\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The number encoding is tied to groups of 11 bits, not 12 bits as claimed.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Finally, we convert these numbers into words and use the joined words as a mnemonic sentence.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"CS = ENT / 32\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated formula.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"MS = (ENT + CS) / 11\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated formula.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Table row shows ENT 128 with CS 4.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Table row shows ENT 128 with ENT+CS 132.\"},\n{